# Rover Blades is a Vehicle with its own double strike (2/2). Crew 2 is not met by Memnite (power 1, refused), but Grizzly Bears crews it on turn 3 and it is a creature, and an
# Equipment that is a creature can't equip (CR 301.5c): its equip ability can be activated, but resolving it attaches nothing and Grizzly Bears gets no double strike. The Blades attacks
# itself, double strike, for 4 (Bot2 20 -> 16); the next turn, no longer a creature, equip does attach.

